CUSTOM BOOKS

1. Drop any UTF-8 .txt or .md book into this folder.
2. Launch the game, or press F5 while it is already running.
3. The book is automatically assigned to the least-full shelf.
4. Walk to that shelf, press E, and read it normally.
5. NPC visitors can also choose custom books.

TITLE
By default the filename becomes the book title.
Leading import numbers are hidden automatically.

Optional metadata at the top of a file:

TITLE: The Clockwork Orchard
AUTHOR: Your Name

Then leave a blank line and write the book normally.

Markdown heading also works:
# The Clockwork Orchard

Subfolders are allowed. Empty .txt/.md files are ignored.

Current custom import formats: .txt and .md
